+"""A small spreadsheet formula engine.
+
+See README.md for the semantics. Values are parsed once into small tuple
+ASTs, cells are ordered by an iterative depth-first walk of the reference
+graph (which is also where cycles are detected), and each AST is then
+evaluated against already-computed dependencies.
+"""
